<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Charles Sherrod | Official Author Website</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS Reset & Variables based on the Book Cover */
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0d0d0c;
            --bg-card: #1c1b1a;
            --text-light: #e6e4e2;
            --text-muted: #a6a3a0;
            --accent-gold: #d19743;
            --accent-glow: rgba(209, 151, 67, 0.15);
            --border-color: #2b2927;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Navigation Bar */
        nav {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        nav .logo {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        nav .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        /* Main Container Layout */
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* Typography Highlights */
        h1, h2, h3 {
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Hero Spotlight Area */
        .hero {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .hero-img-placeholder {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #151413 0%, #252422 100%);
            border: 1px dashed var(--accent-gold);
            height: 450px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-radius: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .hero-content h3 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .hero-content .subtitle {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        /* Poetry & Writings Grid */
        .section-block {
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .poetry-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .poetry-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .poetry-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .poetry-card h4 {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .poetry-excerpt {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-style: italic;
            white-space: pre-line; /* Keeps line breaks intact for poems */
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* About Section layout */
        .about-layout {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .about-layout p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        /* Footer Custom Style */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-top: 80px;
        }

        /* Responsive Layout fixes for mobile devices or half screens */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero, .poetry-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            nav {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }
            nav .nav-links a {
                margin: 0 10px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Main Navigation Bar -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Charles Sherrod</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#book-spotlight">Books</a>
            <a href="#poetry-gallery">Poetry</a>
            <a href="#about-author">About</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- Featured Novel Section -->
        <section id="book-spotlight" class="section-block">
            <h2>Featured Novel</h2>
            <div class="hero">
                <div class="hero-img-placeholder">
                    [ Beyond the Realms of Death Cover Image Here ]
                </div>
                <div class="hero-content">
                    <h3>Beyond the Realms of Death</h3>
                    <p class="subtitle">A Psychological Horror & Supernatural Thriller</p>
                    <p>
                        [Insert a gripping, multi-sentence synopsis of your novel here. Hook the reader with your main protagonist, the central paranormal mystery, and the dark forces that drive the narrative forward.]
                    </p>
                    <p style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">AVAILABLE NOW</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Poetry & Writing Showcase -->
        <section id="poetry-gallery" class="section-block">
            <h2>Poetry & Selected Writings</h2>
            <div class="poetry-grid">
                
                <!-- Poem 1 Card -->
                <div class="poetry-card">
                    <h4>Poem Title One</h4>
                    <p class="poetry-excerpt">
                        First line of your poem goes here
                        Second line follows beautifully
                        And a third dark stanza finishes
                        The text block layout cleanly.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Poem 2 Card -->
                <div class="poetry-card">
                    <h4>Poem Title Two</h4>
                    <p class="poetry-excerpt">
                        Whispers echoing in the deep darkness
                        Shadows stretching across empty spaces
                        Time fading like cold winter breath
                        Leaving tracks of forgotten places.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- About Author Section -->
        <section id="about-author" class="section-block">
            <h2>The Author Behind the Words</h2>
            <div class="about-layout">
                <p>
                    Charles Sherrod is an independent author specializing in dark fiction, tense psychological horror, supernatural thrillers, and evocative poetry. 
                </p>
                <p>
                    With a deep appreciation for rich atmosphere, compelling mysteries, and exploring the unknown, his work probes the thin lines separating reality, memory, and the supernatural.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Page Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Charles Sherrod. All Rights Reserved. Built with GitHub Pages.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
